WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.676
- One of these I do not like.
I don't know which one it is.

00:00:02.676 --> 00:00:04.822
It really doesn't help that we
ate'em all at the same time.

00:00:04.822 --> 00:00:07.572
(dramatic music)

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:15.154
- So we're at Rocket
Park in Houston, Texas.

00:00:15.154 --> 00:00:17.537
And we're in space suits, so
I thought it would be cool

00:00:17.537 --> 00:00:20.175
if we tried Astronaut Ice Cream.

00:00:20.175 --> 00:00:21.008
- All right. Yeah.

00:00:21.008 --> 00:00:21.841
- Let's do this.

00:00:21.841 --> 00:00:23.648
(explosion)

00:00:23.648 --> 00:00:25.293
- So the first one we're trying is

00:00:25.293 --> 00:00:27.752
Chocolate Ice Cream with Chocolate Chips.

00:00:27.752 --> 00:00:30.325
The presentation is not
the best on the inside.

00:00:30.325 --> 00:00:31.830
They were kind of just like, "Here it is."

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:33.406
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

00:00:33.406 --> 00:00:34.968
- Oh wow.
- Mmm.

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.215
- You know the texture is exactly

00:00:36.215 --> 00:00:38.371
like Lucky Charms marshmallows.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:39.204
- Mmm.

00:00:39.204 --> 00:00:40.037
- You want one more?

00:00:40.037 --> 00:00:42.036
- Mmm. On a scale of
one rocket to 10 rocket,

00:00:42.036 --> 00:00:43.547
how good was this one?

00:00:43.547 --> 00:00:44.867
- I'd say at least seven.

00:00:44.867 --> 00:00:46.663
- I'm a chocolate lover.
I'ma give this an eight.

00:00:46.663 --> 00:00:48.461
I'ma take another bite.

00:00:48.461 --> 00:00:50.957
The next one we're trying
is Ice Cream Sandwich.

00:00:50.957 --> 00:00:52.762
Oh, it's cute.

00:00:52.762 --> 00:00:54.437
- Oh yeah. They really got the look of the

00:00:54.437 --> 00:00:55.350
Ice Cream Sandwich down.

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:58.132
Kind of has more of a toast texture.

00:00:58.132 --> 00:01:00.604
- I think I like how cool
and refreshing ice cream is,

00:01:00.604 --> 00:01:01.846
so it's just really weird.

00:01:01.846 --> 00:01:03.204
- I'm gonna put that one at six rockets.

00:01:03.204 --> 00:01:06.313
- I'ma give that one a five. Five rockets.

00:01:06.313 --> 00:01:09.586
We got some freeze-dried Mint
Chocolate Chip Ice Cream.

00:01:09.586 --> 00:01:11.027
Ooo la la.

00:01:11.027 --> 00:01:12.867
(fantasy music)

00:01:12.867 --> 00:01:14.180
(laughter)

00:01:14.180 --> 00:01:15.905
- It's like taking a bite of air.

00:01:15.905 --> 00:01:19.229
- Mint is supposed to hit
you in like a cool, old way.

00:01:19.229 --> 00:01:20.539
It tastes like mint gum was hanging

00:01:20.539 --> 00:01:22.242
in my mouth in my mouth for way too long.

00:01:22.242 --> 00:01:23.398
I give this a two.

00:01:23.398 --> 00:01:25.151
- I was gonna say one,
but I am still eating it,

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:27.801
so I'm gonna go with two.

00:01:27.801 --> 00:01:29.917
- Kind of a Neapolitan-style ice cream.

00:01:29.917 --> 00:01:31.864
- Neapolitan. All right.
Pretty excited about this one.

00:01:31.864 --> 00:01:33.810
- I used to only eat the chocolate part,

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:34.979
'cause I didn't like anything else.

00:01:34.979 --> 00:01:37.162
- Oh. How did everyone else
in the family feel about that?

00:01:37.162 --> 00:01:38.868
- I was the unloved child.

00:01:38.868 --> 00:01:39.722
- Oh.

00:01:39.722 --> 00:01:40.592
- Strawberry first.

00:01:40.592 --> 00:01:41.425
- All right.

00:01:41.425 --> 00:01:43.486
- [Man] Hey, you should
really put one of each

00:01:43.486 --> 00:01:45.020
in your mouth at the same time.

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:48.008
That's how people eat
Neapolitan ice cream.

00:01:48.008 --> 00:01:49.169
- Thanks, random stranger.

00:01:49.169 --> 00:01:50.002
- Sure.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:51.987
- I like it.

00:01:51.987 --> 00:01:52.820
- Do you?

00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:54.528
- This is like that nice
kind of flavor of all

00:01:54.528 --> 00:01:56.394
the ice creams just
kind of working as one,

00:01:56.394 --> 00:01:57.778
in perfect harmony.

00:01:57.778 --> 00:01:59.561
- I think the strawberry
is the one I don't like.

00:01:59.561 --> 00:02:01.378
There's just like not
enough strawberry flavor,

00:02:01.378 --> 00:02:04.125
and it's more just like
hard marshmallow flavor.

00:02:04.125 --> 00:02:05.455
- I'ma give this a seven.

00:02:05.455 --> 00:02:06.916
- Like combined, or one?

00:02:06.916 --> 00:02:09.819
For the strawberry,
negative eight, to bring it

00:02:09.819 --> 00:02:11.804
down to one out of 10.

00:02:11.804 --> 00:02:13.032
- What does that equal?

00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:13.865
- One.

00:02:13.865 --> 00:02:14.698
- Okay.

00:02:15.748 --> 00:02:16.868
- I'd eat this any time. Yeah.

00:02:16.868 --> 00:02:18.523
We don't even have to be in space.

00:02:18.523 --> 00:02:19.834
You can enjoy this anywhere.

00:02:19.834 --> 00:02:21.233
- You know what, if we were in space,

00:02:21.233 --> 00:02:22.402
we wouldn't have options.

00:02:22.402 --> 00:02:23.592
We've learned something today.

00:02:23.592 --> 00:02:25.383
Being an astronaut is very hard.

00:02:25.383 --> 00:02:26.244
- Yeah.

00:02:26.244 --> 00:02:28.042
- But ice cream can make it better.

00:02:28.042 --> 00:02:29.340
- Unless it's mint.

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:30.173
- Unless it's mint.

00:02:30.173 --> 00:02:31.793
- Or strawberry.

00:02:31.793 --> 00:02:34.543
(dramatic music)

